","width":363,"height":258,"width_mm":42.61,"row_group":"z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2412-q16-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n16-I图3\n(2) 如图 3 所示是 “验证动量守恒定律” 的实验装置。实验中能够把速度的测量转化为位移的测量的必要操作是 （填空） 。 (单选)\nA. 轨道应当尽量光滑\nB. 安装轨道时，轨道末端必须水平\nC. 每次必须从同一个高度静止释放小球\nII. (6 分) 小明同学为测出某电源的电动势和内阻, 同时制作一个简易的电子测力计, 设计了如图 1 所示的电路。电路中器材有: 弹簧 (电阻不计, 劲度系数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"k"},{"type":"text","value":" )、电阻箱、电流表、电源、粗细均匀的导体棒、开关。已知滑片固定在弹簧上且与导体棒接触良好, 当弹簧处于原长时, 滑片位于导体棒最左端。已知导体棒的总电阻为 "},{"type":"math","value":"9.0 \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/89937c4b6a70ce8c3324fe59c268d3d783f014f9376faf7534a78a6f5db0fac7.png","width":600,"height":335,"width_mm":70.527,"row_group":"z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2412-q16-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n16-Ⅱ图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a0e89b2460c4b6e1db4f0dc85f65bd47f22be5e4ce1aab0c9e56ffdf30ba70c2.png","width":711,"height":463,"width_mm":83.541,"row_group":"z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2412-q16-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n16-II图2\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a82f1754995e6cedc180a843de3235772846ce1f6e08f04af0c2c54297ced158.png","width":544,"height":359,"width_mm":63.81,"row_group":"z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2412-q16-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n16-Ⅱ图3\n(1) 小明先利用游标卡尺测出导体棒的长度如图 2 所示。则该导体棒的长度为 （填空）mm。\n(2) 他将 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 调到 "},{"type":"math","value":"3.0 \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" , 拉动拉钩, 改变导体棒接入电路中的长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"l"},{"type":"text","value":" , 测出不同 "},{"type":"math","value":"l"},{"type":"text","value":" 对应的电流 "},{"type":"math","value":"I"},{"type":"text","value":" , 并作出 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{I} - l"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像如图 3 所示, 则电源电动势为 （填空） "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{V}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 内阻为 （填空） "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{\\Omega}"},{"type":"text","value":" (结果均保留 2 位有效数字), 内阻的测量值 （填空） 真实值 (填 “大于” “小于” 或 “等于”)。\n(3) 若沿拉钩方向每增加相同的力, 就在电流表表盘上标注一个刻度, 则刻度分布 （填空） (填“均匀”或“不均匀”)。\n(4) 若弹簧的劲度系数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"15 \\mathrm{~N} / \\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" , "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 调为 "},{"type":"math","value":"3.2 \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" , 则对应电流表的刻度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"0.30 \\mathrm{~A}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时, 拉力大小为 （填空） "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\nIII.（2分）根据图示，关于下列实验说法正确的是 （填空） （多选）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/01bc63cca8d5c17293c8a351aca7689517844d2dcb760cb40afced2db9ecc314.png","width":1386,"height":417,"width_mm":162.983,"row_group":"z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2412-q16-row6"},{"type":"text","value":"\nA. 甲图装置中, 插入和抽出条形磁铁, 电流计指针偏转方向一致  \nB. 乙图中目镜观察到的干涉条纹虽然倾斜, 但不影响波长测量的结果  \nC. 丙图中探究气体等温变化规律实验的过程中柱塞应缓慢地向下压或向上拉  \nD. 丁图中测定玻璃的折射率, 如果有几块宽度大小不同的平行玻璃砖可供选择, 为了减小实验误差, 应选用宽度小的玻璃砖来测量"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. I. (6 分)\n(1) ①AC (2分, 漏选得1分) ②C (1分) ③0.44 (2分)\n(2) B (1 分)\nII. (6 分)\n(1) 60.0 (1 分) (2) 3.0 (1 分) 1.8 (1 分) 大于 (1 分)\n(3) 不均匀 (1 分) (4) 40 (1 分)\nIII.（2分）BC（漏选得1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2412-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2412","source_question_id":"z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2412-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"896cf8589b3ff50a96a33a58840f071b74f2ee550e463092519cebfd13630677","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.(8分)某探究小组设计了一个超重报警装置,高为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" 、横截面积为 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" 、导热性能良好的薄壁容器竖直倒置悬挂,在距离容器底部 "},{"type":"math","value":"3L/4"},{"type":"text","value":" 处安装有预警传感器。容器内有一厚度不计、质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的活塞,稳定时正好封闭一段长度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L / 4"},{"type":"text","value":" 的理想气柱如图甲所示。活塞可通过轻绳连接一个沙桶如图乙所示,逐渐往沙桶中加入沙子使活塞缓慢下降,当活塞接触传感器时,系统可发出警报。已知初始时环境热力学温度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{0} = 300\\mathrm{K}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,大气压强为 "},{"type":"math","value":"P_{0} = 1.01 \\times 10^{5} \\mathrm{Pa}, m = 1 \\mathrm{~kg}, L = 0.50 \\mathrm{~m}, S = 100 \\mathrm{~cm}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 重力加速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"g = 10 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 不计摩擦阻力。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ee0cbfc5487c884bcc9756e8b5bb685091d02a1b76c34277ad51e15bbd11d8b4.png","width":611,"height":402,"width_mm":71.79,"row_group":"z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2412-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第17题图甲\n第17题图乙\n(1) 活塞从初始位置到预警位置分子平均动能 （填空） (选填“变大”、“变小”或“不变”), 气体分子的数密度 （填空） (选填“变大”、“变小”或“不变”);\n（2）求触发超重预警时所挂沙和沙桶的总质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":";\n(3) 在 (2) 条件下, 若外界温度缓慢降低 "},{"type":"math","value":"1 \\%"},{"type":"text","value":" , 气体内能减少了 "},{"type":"math","value":"5.75 \\mathrm{~J}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 则气体向外界放出热量 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 为多少?"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. 解:\n(1) 不变 (1 分) 变小 (1 分)\n(2) 轻绳未连重物时, 对活塞, 受到重力和内外气体压力作用, 根据平衡条件得:"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1} S + m g = p _{0} S"},{"type":"text","value":"解得:"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1} = p_{0} - \\frac{mg}{S} = 1 \\times 10^{5} \\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":"刚好触发超重预警时，对活塞受力分析得："},{"type":"math","value":"p_{2}S + (M + m)g = p_{0}S"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n由玻意耳定律得："},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}\\frac{LS}{4}=p_{2}\\frac{3LS}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分\n联立解得："},{"type":"math","value":"M=\\frac{2p_{0}S}{3g}-\\frac{2}{3}m=\\frac{200}{3}kg"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n（3）由盖-吕萨克定律得："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V_2}{T_0} = \\frac{V_3}{0.99T_0}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n其中："},{"type":"math","value":"V_{2}=\\frac{3LS}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"从而解得："},{"type":"math","value":"V_{3}=0.99V_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"则："},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta V = V_{2} - V_{3} = \\frac{3}{400} LS"},{"type":"text","value":"此过程外界对气体做的功为："},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{W} = \\mathrm{p}_2\\Delta \\mathrm{V} = 1.25\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n由热力学第一定律有："},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=Q+W"},{"type":"text","value":"联立可知："},{"type":"math","value":"Q = \\Delta U - W = -5.75 - 1.25 = -7\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"气体放热7J 1分"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2412-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2412","source_question_id":"z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2412-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"75becc49327fe77d536ecf9170c5e750f0ed8fb41ac3557caa9b9fd9a40f4158","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (11 分) 如图所示为半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 0.9 \\mathrm{~m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的四分之一竖直圆弧轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"A B"},{"type":"text","value":" 、传送带 "},{"type":"math","value":"B C"},{"type":"text","value":" 、水平轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"C D E"},{"type":"text","value":" 平滑连接组成的玩具轨道模型, "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" 端的竖直挡板上固定有劲度系数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"k = 1.6 \\mathrm{~N} / \\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的轻质弹簧。现将质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 0.1 \\mathrm{~kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的小物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 从圆心 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 等高处 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 点静止释放, 经过水平传送带 "},{"type":"math","value":"B C"},{"type":"text","value":" 后, 与静止在轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 处, 质量也为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 发生弹性碰撞。初始时 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 与弹簧接触但不粘连。已知传送带的长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"L = 2 \\mathrm{~m}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 以 "},{"type":"math","value":"v = 4 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 顺时针匀速转动, "},{"type":"math","value":"C D"},{"type":"text","value":" 之间的距离 "},{"type":"math","value"